r = nxt\\n\\n    return cur\\n\\n\\ndef _gen_attempt() -> np.ndarray | None:\\n    W = int(np.random.randint(6, 15))\\n    n_runs = int(np.random.randint(2, 7))\\n    heights = [int(np.random.randint(1, 5)) for _ in range(n_runs)]\\n    if heights[0] + 2 * sum(heights[1:]) > 30:\\n        return None\\n    cols: list[int] = []\\n    prev = None\\n    for _ in range(n_runs):\\n        c = int(np.random.randint(1, 10))\\n        while prev is not None and c == prev:\\n            c = int(np.random.randint(1, 10))\\n        cols.append(c)\\n        prev = c\\n    stripes = [np.full((h, W), col, dtype=int) for col, h in reversed(list(zip(cols, heights)))]\\n    return np.vstack(stripes)\\n\\ndef generate_input() -> np.ndarray:\\n    for _ in range(300):\\n        result = _gen_attempt()\\n        if result is not None:\\n            return result\\n    raise RuntimeError(\\\"generate_input failed after 300 attempts\\\")\\n\\n\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo_new/codegen_logs_20260618_122116_seed1155420539_gpt54_xhigh/12_2.log:40:- `description`：将网格中的箭头形标记作为\"投影指令\"，从箭头指向的方向提取源图案的切片，并将切片印到箭头对侧的空白区域。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo_new/codegen_logs_20260618_122116_seed1155420539_gpt54_xhigh/12_2.log:52:- `Key insight`：箭头的位置决定从源图案的哪个截面提取信息，箭头的朝向决定提取方向，而输出绘制方向是箭头朝向的反向。解题者需要同时理解箭头的\"选择\"功能（定位截面）和\"投影\"功能（确定绘制方向），这两个功能编码在同一个标记中。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo_new/seed241687935/_codegen_logs/run_20260619_001243/2_7.log:718:    # leftmost column with any non-black pixels (the \"key pixels\").\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo_new/_codegen_logs/run_20260618_210747_seed1852178230_gpt54_high/seed1852178230__13__codegen_prompts__4.log:27:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_13\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/bash -lc \\\"rg -n \\\\\\\"def main|def generate_input|docstring|mirror|azure|grey\\\\\\\" /home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo_new/seed1852178230 -g '*.py'\\\"\",\"aggregated_o